{"id":"word:hebrew:H3383","type":"word","title":"יַרְדֵּן","subtitle":"H3383 • Hebrew word","simple":{"meaning":"Jarden , the principal river of Palestine","inThisVerse":"The selected word is tied to יַרְדֵּן (H3383) in the Hebrew source text. Part of speech: n-pr.","whyItMatters":"This word appears 183 times in the Hebrew Bible, so BibleIQ can compare how Scripture uses it across multiple passages.","summary":"יַרְדֵּן (Yardên) means Jarden , the principal river of Palestine First listed occurrence: 1Chr 6 63."},"evidence":{"originalLanguage":{"source":"hebrew","word":"יַרְדֵּן","transliteration":"Yardên","pronunciation":"yar-dane'","strong":"H3383","lemmaId":"hebrew:H3383","partOfSpeech":"n-pr","forms":["הַ/יַּרְדֵּ֔ן","הַ/יַּרְדֵּ֑ן","הַ/יַּרְדֵּֽן","הַ/יַּרְדֵּ֖ן","הַ/יַּרְדֵּן֙"],"morphs":[["HTd/Np",145],["HRd/Np",15],["HNp",9],["HR/Np",7],["HTd/Np/Sd",4],["HC/Td/Np",3]]},"definitions":{"short":"Jarden , the principal river of Palestine","usage":"Jordan.","full":"H3383. Yarden יַרְדֵּן 182 proper name, of a river Jordan (according to Rel Ol § 215 c , from ירד with ןֵ֯ for original ןַ֯ , compare ᵐ5 ὁ Ιορδανης ; = river as flowing downward, descending , then of particular stream as river Κατ’ ἐξοχήν . See also Sta § 294 e ( ןֵ֯ for ןֶ֯ , but name according to Sta non-Hebrew)) — absolute always ׳הַיַּר in prose Gen 13:10 162t.; with ה locative הַיַּרְדֵּ֫נָה Judg 8:4 3 t.; יַרְדֵּן only Psa 42:7 ; Job 40:23 ; construct יַרְדֵּן Num 26:3 11 t. Numbers Josh + 1Chr 6:63 ; &#8212; the river of Palestine: in all periods, chiefly Hexateuch (122 t.: Genesis 5 t. J; Numbers 20 t. P, 1 t. J E; Deuteronomy 26 t.; Josh 34 t. J E, 20 t. D, 16 t. P), Judges (12 t.), and Samuel (18 t.); in Kings 13 t.; Chronicles 7 t.; elsewhere 10 t.; — הַזֶּה הַיַּרְדֵּן Gen 32:11 (J), Deut 3:27 ; 31:2 ; Josh 1:2 , 11 ; 4:22 (all D); הַיַּרְדֵּן בְּעֵבֶר Gen 50:10-11 , (J), Josh 7:7 ; 24:8 (both J E), + 20 t. D + Judg 5:17 ; 10:8 ; 1Sam 31:7 ; P has also הַיַּרְדֵּן מֵעֵבֶר Num 32:19 , and ׳מֵע לַיַּרְדֵּן 32:19 ; 32:32 ; 35:14 ; Josh 14:3 , also 17:5 (JE), 18:7 (D), Judg 7:25 ; 1Chr 12:37 ; 26:30 ; in P peculiarly יְרֵחוֺ יַרְדֵּן the Jordan of (at) Jericho , with עַל Num 26:3 , 63 ; 31:12 ; 33:48 , 50 ; 35:1 ; 36:13 , with לְ מֵעֵבֶר 22:1 ; 34:15 ; Josh 13:32 ; 20:8 (= 1Chr 6:63 ), with מִן Josh 16:1 (E?); הַיַּרְדֵּן עֵבֶר Isaiah 8:23; Deut 4:49 ; Josh 13:27 (P); see below עבר ; הַיַּרְדֵּן מֵי 3:13 (twice in verse); 4:18 , 23 (all J E), 3:8 ; 5:1 (both D); הַיַּרְדֵּן מֵימֵי 4:7 (JE); הַיַּר ׳גְּאוֺן Jer 12:5 ; 49:19 ; 50:44 ; Zech 11:3 (see גאון a, above); ׳הַיּר שְׂפַת 2Kin 2:13 ; הַיַּרְדֵּן יַד וְעַל עַלהַֿיָּם יוֺשֵׁב Num 13:29 (J E; elsewhere in Numbers, P); הַיַּרְדֵּן כִּכַּר the circle of Jordan , i.e. the plain about Jericho Gen 13:10-11 , (J), 1Kin 7:46 ; 2Chr 4:17 ; הַיַּר ׳מַעְבְּרוֺת Judg 3:28 ; 12:5-6 , fords of the Jordan ; יִשְׂרָאֵל בְּנֵי אֶלעֵֿבֶר הַיַּרְדֵּן אֶלגְּֿגְּלִילוֺת Josh 22:11 , compare 22:10 (both P; see גלילות above); יַרְדֵּן אֶרֶץ Psa 42:7 (without article only here and in following); אֶלמִּֿיהוּ יָגִּיחַיַרְדֵּן Job 40:23 a Jordan bursteth forth into his mouth.","rootNote":"from 3381 ; a descender;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"1Chr 6 63","keyReferences":["1Chr 6 63","1Chr 6 63","1Chr 12 16","1Chr 12 38","1Chr 19 17","1Chr 26 30","1Kgs 2 8","1Kgs 7 46"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":183,"occurrences":[{"reference":"1Chr 6 63","book":"1Chr","chapter":6,"verse":63,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"לְ/יַרְדֵּ֣ן","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/Np"},{"reference":"1Chr 6 63","book":"1Chr","chapter":6,"verse":63,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הַ/יַּרְדֵּן֒","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTd/Np"},{"reference":"1Chr 12 16","book":"1Chr","chapter":12,"verse":16,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הַ/יַּרְדֵּן֙","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTd/Np"},{"reference":"1Chr 12 38","book":"1Chr","chapter":12,"verse":38,"englishTe